      "mergedPostDetails": "I didnt see a formatting suggestion for a suggestion, just bugs so..\n\nSo yeah, I was told to make a request for tags or vrc label so I'm making it. \n\nThis has also been my number one request for triggers too! I used the VRC_Label quite a lot in the last version of udon",
